      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "**2**\nWorker\na. picks one item off queue\nb. AgentState: creates if new, else\ncontinues if not terminal state\nc. get S2S token for user\nd. invoke MCS + gets mcsCorrId*\ne. saves lifecycle + corrId <->\n   mcsCorrId in AgentState",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1408823582,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
