      "text": "**2**\nWorker\na. picks one item off queue\nb. AgentState: creates if new, else\ncontinues if not terminal state\nc. get S2S token for user\nd. invoke MCS + gets mcsCorrId*\ne. saves lifecycle + corrId <->\n   mcsCorrId in AgentState",
      "textAlign": "center",
